  - m_Id: 26058899291873280
    m_Localized: Welcome to endless, stand in the while line area to start the game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26058916425605120
    m_Localized: Oh you come back to this gamemode ha, so hilarious ive never thought
      someone wil play this gamemode twice again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26058950479159296
    m_Localized: Wait did you just come back again? anyway stand in the white line
      area then ill let my bois to fight with you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26058975758229504
    m_Localized: Stand in the white line area , Stand in the white line area , Stand
      in the white line area
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26058974747402240
    m_Localized: Hah, you seems a true banana man since this is the fourth time you
      open this gamemode, Go ahead let start the game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26059087435767808
    m_Localized: Come on, there is more robots here, but keep in mind they are kindness
